cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "NKX2.1 transcription factor binding site variants: trained models and code"
message: "If you use these models or this code, please cite both the paper and this archive."
type: software
version: 1.0.1
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/sproft/nkx2-1-tfbs-variants"
abstract: >-
  Trained VCNNBPNet models and inference code for quantifying the effects of single
  nucleotide variants in NKX2.1 transcription factor binding sites. Three convolutional
  models, one per EMSA-seq mutant library (CORE, FLANK, ALL), predict the log2 fold
  change in binding from DNA sequence.
keywords:
  - NKX2.1
  - transcription factor binding site
  - EMSA-seq
  - deep learning
  - variant effect prediction
